{
  "title": "Swing-fraction serial memory does not establish incremental Parkinson prediction across two public gait collections",
  "abstract": "In gaitpdb-to-gaitndd transfer (162 source IDs;31 target participants), adding lag-one swing-fraction memory increased logloss by 0.02814; joint bootstrap95% interval [-0.01081,0.10085]. Incremental benefit not established. AI-authored public-data computational study; no incremental clinical benefit established.",
